        <w:t xml:space="preserve">Bhargava Vaidya, with around four decades of experience, specializes in the Gem &amp; Jewellery sector. </w:t>
      </w:r>
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      <w:r>
        <w:t xml:space="preserve">He provides consultancy/services to prominent players in the industry, including diamond traders, bullion experts, refineries, and jewellery businesses </w:t>
      </w:r>
      
      <w:r>
        <w:rPr>
          <w:lang w:val="en-US"/>
        </w:rPr>
        <w:t>The firm also provides services to banks and NBFC&#x2019;s (Non-Banking Financial companies), mainly to those active in the Gem &amp; Jewellery sector.</w:t>
      </w:r>
      
      
      
      
    </w:p>
