      <w:r>
        <w:t>Bhargava has been a member of various committees set up by trade associations, trade bodies and regulators. He has been a consistent participant in the activities of prestigious entities such as the World Gold Council (WGC), Associated Chamber of Commerce &amp; Industry (ASSOCHAM), Federation of Indian Chambers of Commerce &amp; Industry (FICCI), Gem &amp; Jewellery Export Promotion Council (GJEPC), London Bullion Market Association (LBMA), Dubai Multi Commodity Center (DMCC), India Bullion and Jewellers Association (IBJA), the All India Gem &amp; Jewellery Trade Federation (GJF), and various commodity exchanges.</w:t>
      </w:r>
      
      
      
      
    </w:p>
