      <w:r>
        <w:t>She specialises in setting up of alternative investment funds (AIFs) and investment platforms, including in GIFT City, with a strong focus on tax efficiency and regulatory compliance. She supports both Indian and international investors in navigating entry into India, including cross-border tax considerations.</w:t>
      </w:r>
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
