      <w:r>
        <w:t>She also offers end-to-end transaction support, from due diligence and structuring to execution and ongoing compliance. In addition to the above, she also looks at income tax compliances and return filings and assists clients with tax disputes and litigation.</w:t>
      </w:r>
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
    </w:p>
